<title>USA: U.S. Aug industrial output rose 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Aug industrial output rose 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Board report of U.S. industrial production and capacity utilization, seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p> Total Industrial:	  Aug   July   June    May   Aug96/95</p>
<p> Production, Pct Change   0.5    0.1    0.6    0.7     3.4</p>
<p> Previous Estimates		  0.1    0.6    0.5</p>
<p> Production Index-X     126.9  126.3  126.2  125.4</p>
<p>    -			   Aug   July   June    May   Aug'95</p>
<p> Pct of Capacity Use     83.5   83.3   83.5   83.3    83.9</p>
<p> Previous Estimates		 83.2   83.4   83.2</p>
<p>X--1987 equals 100.</p>
<p>Industrial Production,Seasonally adjusted percent changes:</p>
<p>    -			   Aug   July   June    May   Aug96/95</p>
