<p> -Consumer Goods	   -0.6    0.5    0.3    0.4    0.6</p>
<p> -Business Equipment	0.6    0.8    1.5   -0.2    8.6</p>
<p> -Construc.Supplies	-0.3   -1.4    2.5    1.7    4.6</p>
