<p> -Durable Goods	     0.3    0.3    1.5    0.6    6.7</p>
<p> --Primary Metals	  -0.1   -0.9    2.5   -0.5    4.3</p>
<p> --Autos/Light Trucks    -5.5    7.5    2.7   -0.1    7.2</p>
<p>	  Industrial Production,Seasonally adjusted percent</p>
<p>changes:</p>
<p> Manufac.Industry,cont.   Aug   July   June    May    Aug96/95</p>
<p> -Non-Durable Goods	 0.2    0.3   Unch    0.8    0.6</p>
<p> --Petroleum Products     1.8   -1.0    0.4    0.1    2.5</p>
